### 1. View Semua Mahasiswa
GET http://localhost:3000/students

### 1b. Filter Mahasiswa berdasarkan Status (where)
GET http://localhost:3000/students?status=Hadir

### 1c. Statistik Presensi Mahasiswa (count)
GET http://localhost:3000/students/stats

### 2. View 1 Mahasiswa berdasarkan ID
GET http://localhost:3000/students/1

### 3. Tambah Mahasiswa Baru
POST http://localhost:3000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nim": "103022400010",
  "nama": "Ando",
  "status": "Hadir"
}

### 4. Update Mahasiswa
PATCH http://localhost:3000/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Izin"
}

### 5. Hapus Mahasiswa
DELETE http://localhost:3000/students/1
